-- Changes: DROP POLICY x2, REVOKE ALL FROM PUBLIC/anon/authenticated, GRANT SELECT TO anon, authenticated. No data is touched. fulfill_ticket_order / refund_ticket_order / create-checkout / stripe-webhook are NOT changed.
